The Roundhat Gang is a protection racket in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. Its run by [[Tywelwyn Leatherhide]] out of [[The Crowded Flea]]. Recently, it appears to have established some kind of partnership with [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]].

Under [[Tywelwyn Leatherhide]], the Roundhat Gang operates with whatever authority its leader's reputation can command.

Its members gather at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|The Crowded Flea]], where their bouncer's round hat marks the tavern as theirs. A tall half-giant holds court among them there, the one who speaks for the gang to outsiders. When Johnny came asking after [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn]], the half-giant said that if Tywelwyn found Johnny interesting he might meet him the next evening at six on [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Pier 54|Pier 54]].
